## Third-party components

This project bundles and/or redistributes the following open-source software.
Each remains under its own original license; nothing in this project changes
those terms. The full dependency list is recorded in `backend/node_modules`
and `pnpm-lock.yaml` (upstream: deepseek-harness).

- **DeepSeek Harness** (MIT) — Copyright (c) 2026 DeepSeek.
  The `backend/` directory is a built closure of DeepSeek Harness
  (https://github.com/deepseek-ai/deepseek-harness). Its own third-party
  notices are at `backend/node_modules/@deepseek-ai/dsh/` upstream.
- **Electron** (MIT) — Copyright (c) Electron contributors and others.
- **Node.js** (MIT and other permissive licenses) — Copyright (c) Node.js
  contributors and others.
- **rcedit** (MIT) — Copyright (c) rcedit contributors
  (https://github.com/electron/rcedit). Vendored at `tools/rcedit-x64.exe`
  to write the icon and version metadata into the packaged executable.

## Trademarks

This project is an independent, unofficial, community-made desktop client for
DeepSeek Harness. It is **not affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored by
DeepSeek**. The name "DeepSeek Harness" and any DeepSeek marks are used only to
describe compatibility. The application icon is an original design and does not
reproduce any third-party logo or trademark.
